# Transient verification output. The screenshot/render/hydration checks write
# into render-checks/ (or whatever SHOTDIR points at) rather than the repo root
# — see render-checks/README.md. Narrow directory rules on purpose: a broad
# `*.png` ignore would silently drop a legitimate root-level artwork, export or
# logo from Git, which is a worse failure than today's clutter. Real
# deliverables belong in a named directory — see docs/document-library/ and
# docs/contact-sheets/.
/render-checks/*
!/render-checks/README.md
/screenshots/
/test-artifacts/
/playwright-report/
/tmp/
/document-thumbs/
